                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15224174" author="v.pyatkov" created="Mon, 4 Apr 2016 13:57:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I am complete development and testing this fix.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ntikhonov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ntikhonov&quot;&gt;ntikhonov&lt;/a&gt;, you had prepared most part of work relevant to continuous query.&lt;br/&gt;
Please, review it and give an opinion.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15226026" author="ntikhonov" created="Tue, 5 Apr 2016 10:15:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your contibutation!&lt;br/&gt;
Vladislav, could you add tests for different cache configurations (ATOMIC, TX, PARTITION, REPLICATED, with store and etc.)?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15226232" author="v.pyatkov" created="Tue, 5 Apr 2016 13:19:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ntikhonov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ntikhonov&quot;&gt;ntikhonov&lt;/a&gt;, I looked into you comment and added more test cases.&lt;br/&gt;
Could you, please, review my commits again.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15226450" author="ntikhonov" created="Tue, 5 Apr 2016 15:23:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to me.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15226815" author="dmagda" created="Tue, 5 Apr 2016 18:12:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to the master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15227842" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 06:43:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This fix is not efficient: &apos;isEmpty()&apos; call creates two iterators (one for collection, another one for view). Can we change &apos;CacheContinuousQueryHandler.handleEvent&apos; to return already filtered collection and completely avoid views creation?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Nikolay, please take a look.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15228160" author="ntikhonov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 12:06:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Semen,&lt;br/&gt;
Thank you for your notes. I&apos;ve attached patch. Could you please review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15228165" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 12:12:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I see you still create view. Why not create list of CacheContinuousQueryEvent in handleEvent?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15228228" author="ntikhonov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 13:24:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Semen,&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;ve attached patch with fix your notes. Could you look again?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15228238" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 6 Apr 2016 13:30:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good now.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
